{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And He made... and He set... to give light... and to rule... and to divide... that it was good.</b> Regarding the luminaries and the rest of the stars He said 'and He made,' for they were included among the parts of the spheres or the heavens, whose creation He had already recounted (Genesis 1:1); therefore He did not mention for them creation, only making. That is, He brought them into being from a portion of the parts of the spheres, in a spherical configuration and with an illuminating form." "<b>That it was good.</b> That is, He directed this toward the good — which is the end fitting for His act."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:11:56.565858709Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}